You will only sense a conflict when you #offer a sacrifice on an altar that is  
not consecrated to your patron deity; like you are lawful and you offer a  
sacrifice on a chaotic altar.  If you #offer on one that is dedicated to your  
god, you won't sense any conflict.

Offering human corpses is only a good idea if you're chaotic.  Chaotics get +2  
to luck every time they make a human sacrifice.  Non-chaotics get -1 to luck,  
plus they stand a good chance of getting munched by a *non-peaceful* demon  
lord.

Aggravate monster only happens when you eat the corpse.  Sacrificing it doesn't  
really create any problems (if you're chaotic, as I said earlier.)

